{
  "about": [
    "The names the Iridescent Codex prints for the pack's bosses and dimensions, and the words its prose check",
    "recognises them by. Read by dev/codex (codex_facts.py); ids, tiers, places and numbers come from the registries",
    "(kubejs/config/icraft/registry), never from here. Every registry boss (not a second id, `sameAs`) and every",
    "registry dimension needs an entry: the Codex gate fails on one without a name, and on a name the registry no longer has.",
    "name = what the book prints (the game's own English name, from the mod's lang file, unless a line here says otherwise).",
    "match = the words in the book's hand-written text that mean this boss or dimension (case-sensitive, whole words; a",
    "word starting with 'The ' also matches 'the '). [] = never looked for: a common word (Elder, Priest, Storm).",
    "ignore = longer phrases that contain a match word but are something else (Ultimate Wither, Lich Tower).",
    "dimensions: hidden = the reason it is left out of the book's lists; group = listed once under that name.",
    "items: the name of every unique weapon of kubejs/server_scripts/loot/unique_itemset_registry.js (the game's English name).",
    "structures: a structure's name where its id does not spell it (default: the id's path, capitalised).",
    "Strict JSON, no comments."
  ],
